{
  "an9.4:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 9.4 ",
  "an9.4:0.2": "1. Sambodhivagga ",
  "an9.4:0.3": "Nandakasutta ",
  "an9.4:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "an9.4:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena āyasmā nandako upaṭṭhānasālāyaṁ bhikkhū dhammiyā kathāya sandasseti samādapeti samuttejeti sampahaṁseti. ",
  "an9.4:1.3": "Atha kho bhagavā sāyanhasamayaṁ paṭisallānā vuṭṭhito yenupaṭṭhānasālā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bahidvārakoṭṭhake aṭṭhāsi kathāpariyosānaṁ āgamayamāno. ",
  "an9.4:1.4": "Atha kho bhagavā kathāpariyosānaṁ viditvā ukkāsetvā aggaḷaṁ ākoṭesi. ",
  "an9.4:1.5": "Vivariṁsu kho te bhikkhū bhagavato dvāraṁ. ",
  "an9.4:2.1": "Atha kho bhagavā upaṭṭhānasālaṁ pavisitvā paññattāsane nisīdi. ",
  "an9.4:2.2": "Nisajja kho bhagavā āyasmantaṁ nandakaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an9.4:2.3": "“dīgho kho tyāyaṁ, nandaka, dhammapariyāyo bhikkhūnaṁ paṭibhāsi. ",
  "an9.4:2.4": "Api me piṭṭhi āgilāyati bahidvārakoṭṭhake ṭhitassa kathāpariyosānaṁ āgamayamānassā”ti. ",
  "an9.4:3.1": "Evaṁ vutte, āyasmā nandako sārajjamānarūpo bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an9.4:3.2": "“na kho pana mayaṁ, bhante, jānāma ‘bhagavā bahidvārakoṭṭhake ṭhito’ti. ",
  "an9.4:3.3": "Sace hi mayaṁ, bhante, jāneyyāma ‘bhagavā bahidvārakoṭṭhake ṭhito’ti, ettakampi (…) no nappaṭibhāseyyā”ti. ",
  "an9.4:4.1": 